  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Refined Coal.png|200px|left|Refined Coal]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 33\n |price = 1 to 108\n |time = 6 h\n |upgrades = {{Infoicon|ptrain|big|link=Personal Train}}\n |source ={{Infoicon|smelter|bigger|link=Smelter}}\n |xp = 13\n |base = 30\n |time3 = 5 h 6 min\n |dia = 7\n}}\n'''Refined coal''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 33.\n\nRefined coal are used to make [[Jeweler|jewelry]], [[Top Hat|top hats]], and to upgrade the [[Personal Train|personal train]] in the player's [[town]].\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making refined coal'''===\n[[File:Smelter.png|150px|left|Smelter]]\nRefined coal is made in the [[Smelter]].\n\nTo make refined coal, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Coal.png|75px|Coal|link=Coal]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 6 hours to make one bar, and 5 hours 6 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] smelter. Each refined coal gives players 13 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling refined coal'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Refined coal can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 1,080 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bars.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a bar costs 30 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Using refined coal'''===\nRefined coal is used to make the following [[products]]:\n\n{{Item Usage|Refined Coal\n|Iron Bracelet|2|41\n|Top Hat|1|72\n}}\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* As is the case for all Smelter products, completing a [[truck]] order requesting one or more bars rewards players with a random [[voucher]].\n* [[Boat]] orders never ask for refined coal.\n----\n==='''Did you know?'''===\n* In real life, refined coal is simply pure coal that has been polished and cleaned. This is usually done before the coal is burned.\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Veredelte Kohle\n|es = Carbón refinado\n|fr = Charbon raffiné\n|it = Carbone raffinato\n|nl = Verfijnde Steenkool\n|no = Raffinert kull\n|ru = Очищенный уголь\n|zh = Refined Coal\n}}\n[[pt-br:Carvão refinado]]\n\n[[Category:Smelter Products]]\n[[Category:Coal Products]]",
